<title>INDONESIA: Sampoerna reports higher Q1 sales.</title>
<headline>Sampoerna reports higher Q1 sales.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian cigarette maker PT Hanjaya Mandala Sampoerna reported a jump in first quarter 1997 net sales to 561.2 billion rupiah from 446.3 billion in the same 1996 period.</p>
<p>It said cigarette sales amounted to 5,319 million in the first quarter compared with 4,895 million in the 1996 first quarter.</p>
